  "lede": {
    "zh": "三条梯子，各从一个浅显的起点爬到第 1、2 讲的一个核心：一张图为什么定不了深度，透镜怎样在亮和清晰之间取舍，缩放时新像素怎样从四个邻居算出。",
    "en": "Three ladders, each climbing from a plain starting point to a core of lectures 1–2: why one image cannot settle depth, how a lens trades light against sharpness, and how resizing works a new pixel out of four neighbours."
  },
